### List concerts
GET http://localhost:5000/api/concerts?page=1&limit=10

### Search concerts
GET http://localhost:5000/api/concerts?q=Golden

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/concerts/concerts-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/concerts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Silent Waves Concert",
  "artist": "DJ Nova",
  "city": "Surat",
  "date": "2026-12-08",
  "price": 249
}
